// §249 — LATVIAN (chunk K). Keyed by the English source (normalized innerHTML
// for rich blocks, text for plate labels); see src/explain-i18n.js for why.
//
// Vocabulary is the SAME register tier one's chrome uses (src/i18n.js), one
