// zobratiņš, kronis, kolonnu ritenis, modinātāja regulators. One movement
// cannot have two names for a part.
//
// Latvian DECLINES (seven cases), so the hidden .gloss-variants rows list the
// case forms the prose actually uses; a <code> span never takes an ending —
// the prose names the kind of thing first ("konstante <code>X</code>").
//
// NUMBERS AND <code> ARE NOT TRANSLATED — they are the source constants this
// page exists to quote. Emphasis the English carries as CAPITALS rides the
// wording, never an added tag. "modelēts" vs "simulēts" tracks the repo's
// modelled/simulated distinction exactly; HONESTY.lv gates it, and the noun
// «modelis» is deliberately not the honesty word.
