  ['the spring (§268): a 0.100 mm torsion spiral on the hammer\'s post — fall 53.2 → 1.53 ms, blow 17 nJ → 20.5 µJ']: 'atspere (§268): 0.100 mm vērpes spirālatspere uz āmurīša statņa — kritiens 53.2 → 1.53 ms, sitiens 17 nJ → 20.5 µJ',
  ['the case (§269): the foot\'s 0.31 N drives 40.4 g as a rigid body — the fundamental 31.3 → 40.7 dBA, the overtone 52.8 → 55.2']: 'korpuss (§269): pēdas 0.31 N dzen 40.4 g kā stingu ķermeni — pamattonis 31.3 → 40.7 dBA, virstonis 52.8 → 55.2',
  ['−3.7 → 14.0 (§197) → 24.4 (§198) → 24.6 (§253) → 23.2 (§262) → 52.8 (§268) wire alone → 55.4 dBA with the case (§269), at 0.3 m, on axis']: '−3.7 → 14.0 (§197) → 24.4 (§198) → 24.6 (§253) → 23.2 (§262) → 52.8 (§268) stieple viena → 55.4 dBA ar korpusu (§269), pie 0.3 m, uz ass',
